Auxiliary rectifier envelope; assumed raw loads, NOT regulator model
VA s1 bxs1 0
BXs1 bxs1 0 V=25.43636486808268*sin(2*pi*60*time)*max(0,min(1,(0.61-time)/0.01))
VB s2 bxs2 0
BXs2 bxs2 0 V=-25.43636486808268*sin(2*pi*60*time)*max(0,min(1,(0.61-time)/0.01))
RA s1 ac1 1.5539568345323742
RB s2 ac2 1.5539568345323742
D201 ac1 rawp rect
D202 ac2 rawp rect
D203 rawn ac1 rect
D204 rawn ac2 rect
RP rawp cp 0.15
RN rawn cn 0.15
C201 cp 0 0.008
C208 0 cn 5440.0u
IP rawp 0 PWL(0 0 0.05 0 0.06 0.234755806361)
IN 0 rawn PWL(0 0 0.05 0 0.06 0.111965644396)
RBP rawp 0 100meg
RBN 0 rawn 100meg
.model rect D(Is=10n N=1.8 Rs=0.05)
.options reltol=1e-7 abstol=1e-11 vntol=1e-8 method=trap
.save v(rawp) v(rawn) v(cp) v(cn) i(VA) i(VB) @D201[id] @D202[id] @D203[id] @D204[id]
.tran 2e-05 1.1099999999999999 0 2e-05
IR619 rawp 0 PWL(0 0 .05 0 .06 0.00183673469387755)
IR620 0 rawn PWL(0 0 .05 0 .06 0.00183673469387755)
RRAW rawp raw_sense 2940
RRAWG raw_sense 0 1010
RRAWFB detfb raw_sense 1000000
IRAWBIAS raw_sense 0 -6.25e-08
IRAWCAP rawp 0 PWL(0 0 .05 0 .06 0.005)
* Explicit bounded secondary envelope; not a manufacturer diode model
BSA ac1 env I=max(0,v(ac1,env)-0.4)/4606.0-0*min(1,max(0,v(env,ac1)))
BSB ac2 env I=max(0,v(ac2,env)-0.4)/4606.0-0*min(1,max(0,v(env,ac2)))
CENV env 0 2.64e-07
RBENV env 0 10200.0
RSTOP env sense 224400.0
RSBOT sense 0 22440.0
RFBDET detfb sense 8364000.0
VFBDET detfb 0 5.25
VREFDET detref 0 5.015
RBIASDET detref sense 1020000.0
IIBDET sense 0 -6.25e-08
RCAPLEAK env 0 1000000000
.save v(env) v(sense) v(ac1) v(ac2) @BSA[i] @BSB[i]

.end
